{"t":"Weaponmaster","s":"weaponmaster-9f471","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Weaponmaster</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIsle of Destiny\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Island%20of%20Destiny\">Isle of Destiny</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145909&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32085,31977,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32085, 31977, 8)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Assistant</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.62<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 29, 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221219064717&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weaponmaster_e4473e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Weaponmaster.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>One floor down in the Knight's building on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Island%20of%20Destiny\">Island of Destiny</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He's <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Hykrion\">Knight Hykrion</a>'s assistant and you can therefore only reach him if you choose \"knight\" as your vocation. When talking to him, he'll give you a weapon of your choice (Daramian Mace, Steel Axe or Jagged Sword).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Weaponmaster.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nWeaponmaster: Hello <i>Player</i>! I have already heard about you! As our newest member you are eligible to be granted a weapon of your <b>choice</b>!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>choice</b><br/>\nWeaponmaster: You can choose a <b>daramian mace</b>, a <b>steel axe</b> or a <b>jagged sword</b>!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>jagged sword</b><br/>\nWeaponmaster: Sword fighting is a balanced style, not giving up attack power for defense or the other way round. Swords are not as damaging as comparable axes or defensive as comparable maces but does neither share their weaknesses. ...<br/>\nWeaponmaster: Do you want to take the jagged sword as your first weapon?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nWeaponmaster: And here it is! Your first weapon of knighthood! May it serve you well. Remember this choice does not restrict you to this weapon type. You can train your weapon skills freely as it pleases you.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Weaponmaster</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32085,"y":31977,"z":8}}